In a sense Computation represents a graph to be compiled and the executable at the same time.
For PyTorch'/XLA we support multiple kind of devices (CPU, TPU and GPU) and we have some device specified logic in the compilation code. We would need to have torch::lazy::BackendDevice to be added in the torch::lazy::Computation.
